edbackBlock id=\"22ee6ff4649d769d\" body=\"config-path: Fumadocs MDX config file, default to source.config.ts.output-dir: Directory of generated files, default to .source.\">\n  * `config-path`: Fumadocs MDX config file, default to `source.config.ts`.\n  * `output-dir`: Directory of generated files, default to `.source`.\n</FeedbackBlock>\n";
